id: pm-gantt-chart-resource-self-prerequisite
title: Resource scenario SDK throws for a self prerequisite
description: Direct resourceScenarios input with one active task whose prerequisite graph names itself throws from RelationshipGraph before cycle analysis. Schedule drift guards this inherited edge case and reports invalid_graph as a gap; the direct resource API still needs its own typed refusal.
